[Term]
id: ARO:3000111
name: novobiocin
namespace: antibiotic_resistance
def: "Novobiocin is an aminocoumarin antibiotic produced by Streptomyces spheroides and Streptomyces niveus, and binds DNA gyrase subunit B inhibiting ATP-dependent DNA supercoiling." [PMID:10770754, PMID:4680802, PMID:8231802]
