[Term]
id: ARO:3000152
name: minocycline
namespace: antibiotic_resistance
def: "Minocycline is second generation semi-synthetic derivative of the tetracycline group of antibiotics. It inhibits bacterial protein synthesis by binding to the 30S subunit of the bacterial ribosome and preventing the aminotransferase-tRNA from associating with the ribosome." [PMID:11381101, PMID:19862477]
