[Term]
id: ARO:3000156
name: spiramycin
namespace: antibiotic_resistance
def: "Spiramycin is a 16-membered macrolide and is natural product produced by Streptomyces ambofaciens. It binds to the 50S subunit of bacterial ribosomes and inhibits peptidyl transfer activity to disrupt protein synthesis." [PMID:7683018]
