[Term]
id: ARO:3000235
name: ethambutol resistant embB
namespace: antibiotic_resistance
def: "embB gene encodes for an arabinosyl transferase in the arabinogalactan synthesis pathway. It is inhibited by ethambutol. Mutations within the ERDR region of embB confers resistance to ethambutol." [PMID:21444710, PMID:21300839, PMID:9142129]
is_a: ARO:3005005 ! antibiotic-resistant emb arabinosyltransferase
