[Term]
id: ARO:3000265
name: porin OmpF
namespace: antibiotic_resistance
def: "In the presence of antibiotic stress, E. coli overexpresses the global activator protein MarA, which besides inducing MDR efflux pump AcrAB, also down- regulates synthesis of the porin OmpF." [PMID:19100346, PMID:2848006]
is_a: ARO:3004281 ! General Bacterial Porin with reduced permeability to beta-lactams

[Term]
id: ARO:3000269
name: brodimoprim
namespace: antibiotic_resistance
def: "Brodimoprim is a structural derivative of trimethoprim and an inhibitor of bacterial dihydrofolate reductase. The 4-methoxy group of trimethoprim is replaced with a bromine atom." [PMID:8195838, PMID:7562018, PMID:10026296]
