name: facT
namespace: antibiotic_resistance
def: "Efflux protein facT confers resistance to factumycin. The gene has been heterologously expressed in S. coelicolor and its function confirmed. It is possible that this gene can export other kirromycin-like elfamycins, but this has not been tested." [DOI:10.1039/C2MD20038D]
