name: 23S rRNA (adenine(2058)-N(6))-methyltransferase
namespace: antibiotic_resistance
def: "A subclass of 23S rRNA methyltransferase enzymes which dimethylate adenine at position 2058, a modification associated with the macrolide-lincosamide-streptogramin (MLS) antibiotic resistance phenotype." []
